### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api

### Login Bouba
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "bouba@innovatech.com",
  "password": "Bouba123"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("tokenBouba", response.body.token);
%}

### Bouba crée 1 client
POST {{baseUrl}}/clients
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenBouba}}

{
  "nom": "Ndiaye",
  "prenom": "Moussa",
  "email": "moussa.ndiaye@example.com",
  "telephone": "772345678",
  "ville": "Thiès",
  "pays": "Sénégal"
}

### Bouba voit ses clients
GET {{baseUrl}}/clients
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenBouba}}